  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice) and bring to the boil.<br>• Add basmati rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.<br>• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.<br>• Keep covered, until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. <br><br>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don&#39;t peek! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681996c66326cd47f1a59bd5/step-a4c70f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the rice is cooking, cut paneer into bite-sized chunks.<br>• Roughly chop brown onion. <br>• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. <br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook paneer, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, <br>2-4 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681996c66326cd47f1a59bd5/step-1995d110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion and carrot, tossing, until golden, 4-5 minutes. Add garlic, tomato paste, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend see ingredients) and the honey and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.<br>• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in light cooking cream and the water (for the sauce). Return paneer to the pan. Simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Remove pan from heat, then stir in the butter, a pinch of <br>pepper and baby spinach leaves, until spinach is just wilted, 1 minute. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681996c66326cd47f1a59bd5/step-5bbdb020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rice between bowls. Top with paneer butter masala.<br>• Garnish with flaked almonds. Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681996c66326cd47f1a59bd5/step-98759830.jpg"
    }
  ]
